WEBVTT

00:09:57.825 --> 00:10:00.771
and if you keep reading the
first letters of the clues down,

00:10:00.771 --> 00:10:03.572
you get cobalt horse,

00:10:03.572 --> 00:10:07.060
amber owl, silver ox,

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:10.558
red donkey, and emerald rooster.

00:10:10.558 --> 00:10:12.164
(Applause)

00:10:12.164 --> 00:10:17.735
That's pretty cool, right?

00:10:17.735 --> 00:10:19.446
It's The New York Times.

00:10:19.446 --> 00:10:21.022
But wait, wait, wait, wait. Wait.

00:10:21.022 --> 00:10:22.544
Oh, Gwen,

00:10:22.544 --> 00:10:25.148
do you recall how I forgot my purple marker,

00:10:25.148 --> 00:10:28.195
and you were unable to color the sheep?

00:10:28.195 --> 00:10:29.648
Well, if you keep reading

00:10:29.648 --> 00:10:31.279
starting with 25-down,